ion. Origami’s Drag Settings"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provide momentum and rubber-band bounds; the placed Interaction → Pulse chain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resets releases near the origin."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","title":"Interaction_DragView"}}}